# 🧭 **1. Purpose of the Provenance Manifest**

The Provenance Manifest:

- records the entire simulation lineage  
- binds all phases into a single governed chain  
- declares the final PASS/FAIL  
- ensures falsifiability  
- ensures auditability  
- ensures no post‑hoc tuning occurred  

It is the **official record** of the simulation.

