# ⚙️ **4. Execution Logic (governed)**

The Provenance Manifest:

- loads all phase outputs  
- verifies each phase PASS/FAIL  
- checks for invariant violations  
- checks for threshold violations  
- checks for acceptance failures  
- computes global PASS/FAIL  
- records the simulation fingerprint  
- seals the simulation  

This is the **final governed decision**.

---

# 🔮 **5. PASS/FAIL Logic**

The simulation is **PASS** only if:

- baseline PASS  
- shock PASS  
- relaxation PASS  
- spectral PASS  
- no invariant violations  
- no threshold violations  
- no acceptance failures  

If any phase fails, **global_pass = false**.

